<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8">
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">

    <title>{{ metadata.report_title }}</title>

    <style>
        {% include "reports/assets/report.css" %}
    </style>
</head>

<body>

<div class="report-container">

    <header class="report-header">
        <div class="report-label">CRYPTOGRAPHIC SECURITY ASSESSMENT</div>

        <h1>{{ metadata.report_title }}</h1>

        <p class="organization">{{ metadata.organization }}</p>

        <p>
            TLS cryptographic inventory and configuration assessment
        </p>
    </header>


    <section class="metadata-section">
        <h2>Report Information</h2>

        <table>
            <tr>
                <th>Report ID</th>
                <td>{{ metadata.report_id }}</td>
            </tr>
            <tr>
                <th>Report Version</th>
                <td>{{ metadata.report_version }}</td>
            </tr>
            <tr>
                <th>Generated</th>
                <td>{{ metadata.generated_at }}</td>
            </tr>
            <tr>
                <th>Prepared By</th>
                <td>{{ metadata.author }}</td>
            </tr>
            <tr>
                <th>Organization</th>
                <td>{{ metadata.organization }}</td>
            </tr>
            <tr>
                <th>Methodology Versions</th>
                <td>
                    {{ overview.methodology_versions | join(", ")
                       if overview.methodology_versions else "Not recorded" }}
                </td>
            </tr>
        </table>
    </section>


    <section>
        <h2>1. Executive Summary</h2>

        <div class="summary-grid">

            <div class="summary-card">
                <span class="summary-value">
                    {{ overview.total_assessment_runs }}
                </span>
                <span class="summary-label">Assessment Runs</span>
            </div>

            <div class="summary-card">
                <span class="summary-value">
                    {{ overview.policies_executed | length }}
                </span>
                <span class="summary-label">Policies Executed</span>
            </div>

            <div class="summary-card">
                <span class="summary-value">
                    {{ overview.scan_status_counts.completed }}
                </span>
                <span class="summary-label">Completed Scans</span>
            </div>

            <div class="summary-card">
                <span class="summary-value">
                    {{ overview.policy_execution_counts.failed }}
                </span>
                <span class="summary-label">Failed Policies</span>
            </div>

        </div>

        <p>
            This report records TLS evidence collected from the assessed
            targets and the results produced by the configured assessment
            policies.
        </p>

        <div class="notice">
            Finding classifications are policy-specific outcomes.
            They are not an aggregate security rating or a determination
            of overall post-quantum cryptography readiness.
        </div>
    </section>


    <section>
        <h2>2. Assessment Overview</h2>

        <h3>Policy Execution Status</h3>

        <table>
            <thead>
                <tr>
                    <th>Status</th>
                    <th>Count</th>
                </tr>
            </thead>
            <tbody>
                {% for status, count in overview.policy_execution_counts.items() %}
                <tr>
                    <td>{{ status | replace("_", " ") | title }}</td>
                    <td>{{ count }}</td>
                </tr>
                {% endfor %}
            </tbody>
        </table>

        <h3>TLS Collection Status</h3>

        <table>
            <thead>
                <tr>
                    <th>Status</th>
                    <th>Count</th>
                </tr>
            </thead>
            <tbody>
                {% for status, count in overview.scan_status_counts.items() %}
                <tr>
                    <td>{{ status | title }}</td>
                    <td>{{ count }}</td>
                </tr>
                {% endfor %}
            </tbody>
        </table>

        <h3>Finding Classifications</h3>

        <table>
            <thead>
                <tr>
                    <th>Classification</th>
                    <th>Count</th>
                </tr>
            </thead>
            <tbody>
                {% for classification, count in overview.classification_counts.items() %}
                <tr>
                    <td>
                        {{ classification | replace("_", " ") | title }}
                    </td>
                    <td>{{ count }}</td>
                </tr>
                {% endfor %}
            </tbody>
        </table>
    </section>


    <section>
        <h2>3. Policy Catalogue and Methodology</h2>

        {% set policy_catalogue = namespace(seen=[]) %}

        {% for run in assessment_runs %}
            {% for policy_id, record in run.assessments.items() %}

                {% if policy_id not in policy_catalogue.seen %}

                    {% set policy_catalogue.seen =
                        policy_catalogue.seen + [policy_id] %}

                    {% set policy = record.metadata %}

                    <div class="policy-card">

                        <h3>
                            {{ policy.name }}
                            <span class="policy-id">({{ policy.policy_id }})</span>
                        </h3>

                        <table>
                            <tr>
                                <th>Version</th>
                                <td>{{ policy.version }}</td>
                            </tr>
                            <tr>
                                <th>Description</th>
                                <td>{{ policy.description }}</td>
                            </tr>
                            <tr>
                                <th>Scope</th>
                                <td>{{ policy.scope | join("; ") }}</td>
                            </tr>
                        </table>

                        <h4>Assessment Rules</h4>

                        <table>
                            <thead>
                                <tr>
                                    <th>Rule</th>
                                    <th>Dimension</th>
                                    <th>Description</th>
                                </tr>
                            </thead>
                            <tbody>
                                {% for rule in policy.rules %}
                                <tr>
                                    <td>{{ rule.rule_id }} — {{ rule.name }}</td>
                                    <td>{{ rule.dimension }}</td>
                                    <td>{{ rule.description }}</td>
                                </tr>
                                {% endfor %}
                            </tbody>
                        </table>

                        {% if policy.references %}
                        <h4>References</h4>

                        <ul>
                            {% for reference in policy.references %}
                            <li>
                                <strong>{{ reference.title }}</strong>
                                — {{ reference.publisher }}
                                <br>
                                <span class="reference-url">
                                    {{ reference.url }}
                                </span>
                            </li>
                            {% endfor %}
                        </ul>
                        {% endif %}

                    </div>

                {% endif %}

            {% endfor %}
        {% endfor %}
    </section>


    <section>
        <h2>4. Target Assessment Results</h2>

        {% for run in assessment_runs %}

        <article class="target-section">

            <h3>{{ loop.index }}. {{ run.domain }}</h3>

            <p>
                <strong>Collection Status:</strong>
                <span class="status status--{{ run.evidence.scan_status }}">
                    {{ run.evidence.scan_status | replace("_", " ") | title }}
                </span>
            </p>

            <table>
                <tr>
                    <th>Assessment Run ID</th>
                    <td>{{ run.assessment_run_id }}</td>
                </tr>
                <tr>
                    <th>Target Type</th>
                    <td>{{ run.evidence.target_type }}</td>
                </tr>
                <tr>
                    <th>Port</th>
                    <td>{{ run.evidence.port }}</td>
                </tr>
                <tr>
                    <th>Assessment Date</th>
                    <td>{{ run.created_at }}</td>
                </tr>
                <tr>
                    <th>Methodology Version</th>
                    <td>{{ run.methodology_version }}</td>
                </tr>
            </table>


            <h4>Policy Execution Results</h4>

            {% for policy_id, record in run.assessments.items() %}

                {% set policy = record.metadata %}
                {% set result = record.result %}

                <div class="policy-result">

                    <h4>
                        {{ policy.name }}
                        ({{ policy_id }})
                    </h4>

                    <p>
                        <strong>Execution Status:</strong>
                        <span class="status status--{{ result.execution_status }}">
                            {{ result.execution_status | replace("_", " ") | title }}
                        </span>
                    </p>

                    {% if result.findings %}

                    <h5>Findings</h5>

                    <table>
                        <thead>
                            <tr>
                                <th>Finding ID</th>
                                <th>Rule</th>
                                <th>Dimension</th>
                                <th>Observed Value</th>
                                <th>Classification</th>
                            </tr>
                        </thead>
                        <tbody>
                            {% for finding in result.findings %}
                            <tr>
                                <td>{{ finding.finding_id }}</td>
                                <td>{{ finding.rule_id }}</td>
                                <td>{{ finding.dimension }}</td>
                                <td>{{ finding.observed_value or "Not available" }}</td>
                                <td>
                                    {{ finding.classification
                                       | replace("_", " ") | title }}
                                </td>
                            </tr>
                            {% endfor %}
                        </tbody>
                    </table>

                    {% else %}
                    <p>No findings were recorded for this policy.</p>
                    {% endif %}

                    {% if result.limitations %}
                    <h5>Execution Limitations</h5>
                    <ul>
                        {% for limitation in result.limitations %}
                        <li>{{ limitation }}</li>
                        {% endfor %}
                    </ul>
                    {% endif %}

                </div>

            {% endfor %}


            <h4>TLS Connection Evidence</h4>

            <table>
                <tr>
                    <th>TLS Version</th>
                    <td>{{ run.evidence.get("tls_version") or "Not available" }}</td>
                </tr>
                <tr>
                    <th>Cipher Suite</th>
                    <td>{{ run.evidence.get("cipher_suite") or "Not available" }}</td>
                </tr>
                <tr>
                    <th>Cipher Strength</th>
                    <td>{{ run.evidence.get("cipher_strength") or "Not available" }}</td>
                </tr>
                <tr>
                    <th>Key Establishment Group</th>
                    <td>
                        {{ run.evidence.get("key_establishment_group")
                           or "Not available" }}
                    </td>
                </tr>
                <tr>
                    <th>Key Establishment Evidence</th>
                    <td>
                        {{ run.evidence.get("key_establishment_evidence_status")
                           or "Not available" }}
                    </td>
                </tr>
                <tr>
                    <th>Certificate Verification</th>
                    <td>
                        {{ run.evidence.get("certificate_verification_status")
                           or "Not available" }}
                    </td>
                </tr>
            </table>


            <h4>Certificate Evidence</h4>

            <table>
                <tr>
                    <th>Certificate Version</th>
                    <td>{{ run.evidence.get("certificate_version") or "Not available" }}</td>
                </tr>
                <tr>
                    <th>Public-Key Algorithm</th>
                    <td>
                        {{ run.evidence.get("public_key_algorithm")
                           or "Not available" }}
                    </td>
                </tr>
                <tr>
                    <th>Public-Key Variant</th>
                    <td>
                        {{ run.evidence.get("public_key_variant")
                           or "Not available" }}
                    </td>
                </tr>
                <tr>
                    <th>Key Size</th>
                    <td>{{ run.evidence.get("key_size") or "Not available" }}</td>
                </tr>
                <tr>
                    <th>Certificate Signature Algorithm</th>
                    <td>
                        {{ run.evidence.get("certificate_signature_algorithm_oid")
                           or "Not available" }}
                    </td>
                </tr>
                <tr>
                    <th>Valid Until</th>
                    <td>{{ run.evidence.get("not_after") or "Not available" }}</td>
                </tr>
            </table>


            <h4>Collection Diagnostics</h4>

            {% if run.evidence.diagnostics %}

            <table>
                <thead>
                    <tr>
                        <th>Severity</th>
                        <th>Category</th>
                        <th>Code</th>
                        <th>Stage</th>
                        <th>Message</th>
                    </tr>
                </thead>
                <tbody>
                    {% for diagnostic in run.evidence.diagnostics %}
                    <tr>
                        <td>{{ diagnostic.severity }}</td>
                        <td>{{ diagnostic.category }}</td>
                        <td>{{ diagnostic.code }}</td>
                        <td>{{ diagnostic.stage }}</td>
                        <td>{{ diagnostic.message }}</td>
                    </tr>
                    {% endfor %}
                </tbody>
            </table>

            {% else %}
            <p>No collection diagnostics were recorded.</p>
            {% endif %}

        </article>

        {% endfor %}
    </section>


    <section>
        <h2>5. Classification and Interpretation</h2>

        <table>
            <thead>
                <tr>
                    <th>Classification</th>
                    <th>Interpretation</th>
                </tr>
            </thead>
            <tbody>
                <tr>
                    <td>Acceptable</td>
                    <td>
                        Observed evidence meets the applicable implemented
                        assessment rule.
                    </td>
                </tr>
                <tr>
                    <td>Acceptable with Review</td>
                    <td>
                        Further security review or contextual consideration
                        is required.
                    </td>
                </tr>
                <tr>
                    <td>Unacceptable</td>
                    <td>
                        Observed evidence does not meet the applicable
                        implemented assessment rule.
                    </td>
                </tr>
                <tr>
                    <td>Unknown</td>
                    <td>
                        Available evidence is insufficient for a
                        conclusive classification.
                    </td>
                </tr>
            </tbody>
        </table>
    </section>


    <section>
        <h2>6. Limitations</h2>

        <ul>
            <li>
                Findings are limited to collected evidence and implemented
                assessment rules.
            </li>
            <li>
                Partial or failed collection can reduce available evidence.
            </li>
            <li>
                TLS endpoint observations do not enumerate every
                organizational cryptographic dependency.
            </li>
            <li>
                Certificate metadata alone does not establish complete
                certificate-chain trust.
            </li>
            <li>
                PQC readiness requires broader evidence about applications,
                protocols, vendors, dependencies and migration plans.
            </li>
        </ul>
    </section>


    <section>
        <h2>7. Conclusion</h2>

        <p>
            This report provides a structured record of TLS evidence and
            policy assessment results for the specified targets. It supports
            technical review, cryptographic inventory development and
            prioritization of further investigation.
        </p>

        <p>
            Findings should be interpreted within the documented scope and
            limitations of the assessment methodology.
        </p>
    </section>


    <footer class="report-footer">
        <p>End of Report</p>
        <p>
            Report ID: {{ metadata.report_id }}
            | Version: {{ metadata.report_version }}
            | Generated: {{ metadata.generated_at }}
        </p>
    </footer>

</div>

</body>
</html>
